  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 3.7 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New Features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Developers now need to provide a description for all beta localizations before submitting to beta app review for external testing with TestFlight. You can update `betaAppLocalizations` with `PATCH-v1-betaAppLocalizations-_id_`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-betaAppLocalizations-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Added `WIN_BACK_ELIGIBILITY` report type to `GET-v1-salesReports`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-salesReports"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Name is now a required field when using `POST-v1-appInfoLocalizations`. To see other attributes you can create or modify, see  `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-appInfoLocalizations",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppInfoLocalizationCreateRequest/Data-data.dictionary/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Developers can now look up in-app purchase price point equalization using `GET-v1-inAppPurchasePricePoints-_id_-equalizations`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-inAppPurchasePricePoints-_id_-equalizations"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The enum `UNIVERSAL` is now added to `BundleIdPlatform`. To learn more, see `https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/preparing-your-app-for-distribution/#Set-the-bundle-ID`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/BundleIdPlatform",
            "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/preparing-your-app-for-distribution/#Set-the-bundle-ID"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The enums `DEVELOPER_ID_APPLICATION_G2` and `DEVELOPER_ID_KEXT_G2` are now available when using `CertificateType`. To learn more, see `https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/notarizing-macos-software-before-distribution` and `https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/technotes/tn2206/_index.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/DTS40007919`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/CertificateType",
            "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/notarizing-macos-software-before-distribution",
            "https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/technotes/tn2206/_index.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/DTS40007919"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now read age ratings for France by using `GET-v1-appInfos-_id_`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-appInfos-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `GET-v1-apps-_id_-alternativeDistributionKey` endpoint now shows multiple distribution keys when you have multiple configured.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-apps-_id_-alternativeDistributionKey"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is a new required attribute `defaultFormatter` when you use `POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboards`, which gives all your localizations the same formatter. To learn more, see `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboards",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterLeaderboardCreateRequest/Data-data.dictionary/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The attribute `previewImage` on `Attributes-data.dictionary` is deprecated. Use `previewFrameImage` and `PreviewFrameImage` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppPreview/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PreviewFrameImage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `assetDeliveryState` on `Attributes-data.dictionary` is deprecated. Use `videoDeliveryState` and `AppMediaVideoState` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppPreview/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppMediaVideoState"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `previewImage` on `Attributes-data.dictionary` is deprecated. Use `previewFrameImage` and `PreviewFrameImage` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppEventVideoClip/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PreviewFrameImage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `assetDeliveryState` on `Attributes-data.dictionary` is deprecated. Use `videoDeliveryState` and `AppMediaVideoState` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppEventVideoClip/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppMediaVideoState"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `appStoreState` on `Attributes-data.dictionary` is deprecated. Use `state` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppInfo/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `appStoreState` on `Attributes-data.dictionary` is deprecated. Use `appVersionState` and `AppVersionState` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppStoreVersion/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppVersionState"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The relationship `groupLeaderboardSet` on `Relationships-data.dictionary` is deprecated.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterLeaderboardSet/Relationships-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The relationship `groupAchievement` on `Relationships-data.dictionary` is deprecated.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterAchievement/Relationships-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The relationship `groupLeaderboard` on `Relationships-data.dictionary` is deprecated.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterLeaderboard/Relationships-data.dictionary"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The `v1/appPreOrders` and `v1/appAvailabilities` resources are removed and replaced with `v2/appAvailabilities`. To learn more, see `app-availability`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-availability"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`WATCH_SERIES_4` and `WATCH_SERIES_3` enums are removed from `PreviewType`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PreviewType"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `subscription` include for `GET-v1-subscriptionAvailabilities-_id_` is removed.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-subscriptionAvailabilities-_id_"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
